Source code in this repository is variously licensed under the BSD-3-Clause
License, or the Weaviate License.

The license of all source code can be identified by its location in this
repository:

* Outside of the "wl" directory, source code in a given file is licensed under
  the BSD-3-Clause License, as defined in LICENSE-BSD.

* Within the "wl" directory and all its sub-directories, source code in a
  givenfile is licensed under the Weaviate license, as defined in
  wl/LICENSE-WEAVIATE.

Weaviate-licensed features are toggled using an environment variable. Setting
WEAVIATE_LICENSE to true, on, enabled or 1 (case-insensitive) enables the
Weaviate-licensed functionality in the "wl" directory. With any other value,
or when the variable is unset, only BSD-3-Clause-licensed code is executed.

